    "description": "This API facilitates the updating of banking account transfer details in bulk. Users can modify existing transfer entries, ensuring that the information remains accurate and up-to-date. Financial institutions and developers managing banking applications can leverage this endpoint to maintain compliance and enhance user experience by ensuring timely updates. The API streamlines operations for entities that require batch processing capabilities for transfers, making it an essential tool for banking services.",
